{"text":"power of words, which is I included both slave posters and kind of KKK text posters that had been used because I think it's important to show the full dexterity of what words can do and what you know the hurt that they can cause as well. This is a poem I wrote based off of an old film called The Murder in Mississippi. Don't watch it. I do not want to wasting your valuable beautiful lives, but it was one director's attempt at kind of talking about this in Mississippi in the 1960s. And so this is kind of a similar poem where I decided to take some of the better lines from that film and incorporate it into my own piece. It's called Arselle's Highfalutin Negroes. The word shumbles in the mouth like a pit. Sit down boy. I said sit down boy. Do what the law tells you to do.","words":[{"text":"power","start":0.0,"end":0.62},{"text":"of","start":0.62,"end":0.88},{"text":"words","start":0.88,"end":1.26,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":1.32,"end":1.52},{"text":"is","start":1.52,"end":1.7},{"text":"I","start":1.7,"end":1.86},{"text":"included","start":1.86,"end":2.28},{"text":"both","start":2.28,"end":2.76},{"text":"slave","start":3.34,"end":3.86},{"text":"posters","start":3.86,"end":4.38},{"text":"and","start":4.38,"end":4.86},{"text":"kind","start":4.86,"end":5.0},{"text":"of","start":5.0,"end":5.16},{"text":"KKK","start":5.16,"end":5.6},{"text":"text","start":5.6,"end":6.14},{"text":"posters","start":6.14,"end":6.54},{"text":"that","start":6.54,"end":6.68},{"text":"had","start":6.68,"end":6.82},{"text":"been","start":6.82,"end":6.96},{"text":"used","start":6.96,"end":7.38},{"text":"because","start":7.38,"end":7.8},{"text":"I","start":7.8,"end":8.0},{"text":"think","start":8.0,"end":8.22},{"text":"it's","start":8.22,"end":8.42},{"text":"important","start":8.42,"end":8.82},{"text":"to","start":8.82,"end":9.08},{"text":"show","start":9.08,"end":9.68},{"text":"the","start":9.68,"end":10.26},{"text":"full","start":10.26,"end":10.52},{"text":"dexterity","start":10.52